{"id": "biz-3", "headline": "S&P 500 falls a fifth straight day", "source": "Pittsburgh Post-Gazette", "url": "https://www.post-gazette.com/business/personal-finance/stock-market-today-november-18-2026-OPGMZLWL7E36MRNUL7DIGS5LLQ/", "published": "2026-11-18", "url_verified": true, "pages": ["The S&P 500 fell for a fifth straight session on Wednesday, Nov. 18, its longest losing streak since June, according to Post-Gazette market coverage. Another market report put the Dow Jones Industrial Average down 561 points on the day, while the Nasdaq edged higher ahead of the expected Anthropic public offering. Investors have been wary of AI stock valuations and the Iran conflict. A long losing streak can weigh on retirement accounts and consumer confidence.\nSource: Pittsburgh Post-Gazette"], "qr": {"n": 41, "rows": ["11111110010011001111101101000111101111111", "10000010111101111000001001011000101000001", "10111010001111001011110100011001101011101", "10111010100100101000011110101110001011101", "10111010010000010100111001011001001011101", "10000010101111011010010011111010001000001", "11111110101010101010101010101010101111111", "00000000001110110000110110111000000000000", "11111011101111110101001011100101010101010", "00000001011010001011110111001001101111011", "10001010010110010010111000111110100100000", "00011001011000111000111110001010100111001", "01100111100010010111011000100111100001101", "11101100001001111110110000111101011111001", "10010111010111000100111001011110100000000", "00011000001100101010111000001010001111010", "01100010110101001100001101110100010100100", "01001000011101001111001100101011011110011", "00001010011001111100011001111010001100000", "01011001110001000000110110100010100111010", "10111011001000111011100010110110100101100", "11111100011011010011011000011001011110001", "10100110111000111010100010110000101101000", "10101001001010110001010100110000111101010", "01101011111011111100001001110101100101111", "10101001001100001011111101101001101110001", "1101011110